{"root":{"data":{"text":"信息技术学科专业知识","background":"#974706","color":"#ffffff","font-weight":"bold"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bmy0975r8tko","created":1531727987336,"text":"信息系统","background":"#4f81bd","color":"#ffffff","layout":null,"font-size":18},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bmy09dpa7ugw","created":1531728001577,"text":"概述","font-weight":"bold","layout":null,"background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk96ly52uu80","created":1785138004985,"text":"计算机组成与程序设计语言的发展：\n第一代电子管 机器语言和汇编语言\n第二代晶体管 操作系统和高级语言\n第三代集成电路 \n第四代超大规模集成电路","layout_right_offset":{"x":9,"y":-40},"background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96mxis4000","created":1785138082001,"text":"全文检索：指计算机索引程序通过扫描文章中的每一个词，\n对每一个词建立一个索引，指明该词在文章中出现的次数\n和位置，当用户查询时，检索程序就根据事先建立的索引\n进行查找，并将查找的结果反馈给用户的检索方式（百度、Google）\n目录搜索检索：按照级别，逐级查询，代表的搜索引擎有新浪、雅虎\n元搜索：没有自己的数据库，代表网站是360\n不存在特色信息检索引擎","background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000","layout_right_offset":{"x":8.5,"y":-31}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bmy09eb3zu8s","created":1531728002897,"text":"计算机系统","font-weight":"bold","layout":null,"background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96fggd0280","created":1785137496300,"text":"数值与编码","background":"#b8cce4","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96fiep7fk0","created":1785137500553,"text":"安全及维护","background":"#b8cce4","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bmy09a2gllsg","created":1531727993667,"text":"新技术及应用","background":"#f79646","layout":null,"color":"#ffffff","font-size":18},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bmy09f949og0","created":1531728004953,"text":"物联网","background":"#fde9d9","font-weight":"bold","layout":null,"color":"#000000"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96g1g2l1s0","created":1785137541995,"text":"大数据","background":"#fde9d9","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96g2oikvc0","created":1785137544682,"text":"云计算","backgrou